// Hand-maintained State TSA Conference dates, 2026-2027 season.
//
// Separate from src/data/tsaCalendar.js (auto-generated from the National
// TSA calendar feed, do not hand-edit) because state conference dates come
// from each state delegation's own official site/social, not from National
// TSA's calendar. Same event shape as CALENDAR_EVENTS so it merges through
// the exact same pipeline (see Calendar.jsx, HomeCalendarWidget.jsx,
// utils/calendarItems.js) — this is not a second calendar system, just a
// second source feeding the one merge point.
//
// Every entry below was verified directly against its official source URL
// (fetched twice — once during initial research, once again as a final
// accuracy check) as of 2026-10-11. Only states with a confirmed, explicitly
// 2026-2027-season date are listed. Most states do not yet have a verified
// date and are intentionally left out rather than guessed — see the
// research report for the full list of what was checked but not found.
//
// Utah holds two separate single-day conferences (Middle School, then High
// School, on consecutive days) rather than one multi-day conference, so it
// gets two entries instead of one date range, matching what's actually on
// their official page.
// ============================================================================

